title: Between Artur Mas and the CUP
subtitle: Widespread #PressingCUP campaign sets social media on fire.
tags: event
role: event
new-page: true
view-if: not rubicon and parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase > 0 and coalition_phase_timer > 0 and parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_round < parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase and (parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name = "Artur Mas") and player_party = "erc"
face-image: img/events/pressing_cup.jpg

= Between ​Artur Mas and the ​CUP

Between negotiations recesses and pauses, it's hard not to look at social media, where the #PressingCUP campaign only grows further and louder. Arguing that the elections had a clear candidate winning, they demand the CUP reconsiders their veto.

- @defend
- @press
- @private
- @public

@defend
title: Defend [+ parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name +] unquestionably
subtitle: [? if parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind = "jxsi" or parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind = "jxcat": We must preserve unity around the agreed list.?][? if parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind != "jxsi" and parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind != "jxcat": We must preserve the chance of an agreement with [+ parlament_current_ciu +].?]
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.rubicon || Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase < 1 || Q.coalition_phase_timer <= 0 || (Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_round || 0) >= Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase) return;
    if (Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name != "Artur Mas" && Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name != "Neus Munté") return;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_round = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_ciu_pressure = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_ciu_pressure || 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mas_pressure = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mas_pressure || 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mas_pressure += 1;
    Q.cup_relations -= 2;
!}

We have keep the line and have rallied around [+ parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name +]. It's unclear how much will the CUP's position change only by doing this, but we are at least keeping or stance.

@press
title: Further press CUP to accept an "exceptional" agreement
subtitle: The CUP may not look kindly upon us, but we do have momentum on our side after all.
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.rubicon || Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase < 1 || Q.coalition_phase_timer <= 0 || (Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_round || 0) >= Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase) return;
    if (Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name != "Artur Mas" && Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name != "Neus Munté") return;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_round = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_ciu_pressure = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_ciu_pressure || 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mas_pressure = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mas_pressure || 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mas_pressure += 2;
    Q.cup_relations -= 5;
!}

While keeping the line and rallying around [+ parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name +], we have fully joined into the discourse against the anticapitalist formation, pushing them further into public dilapidation. It's unclear how much will the CUP's position change only by doing this, though.

@private
title: Privately propose alternative formulas to [+ parlament_current_ciu +]
subtitle: [? if parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind = "jxsi" or parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind = "jxcat": This would go against the agreements that made possible a unity list in the first place, but the chance is there.?][? if parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind != "jxsi" and parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind != "jxcat": We could ask [+ parlament_current_ciu +] to reconsider their candidate, if that's what it takes to reach an agreement.?]
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.rubicon || Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase < 1 || Q.coalition_phase_timer <= 0 || (Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_round || 0) >= Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase) return;
    if (Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name != "Artur Mas" && Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name != "Neus Munté") return;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_round = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_ciu_pressure = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_ciu_pressure || 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mas_pressure = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mas_pressure || 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_ciu_pressure += 1;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_brokerage = true;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 2;
!}

While publicly we are keeping the line and rallying around [+ parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name +], we have been trying to at least raise some ideas on thinking about different candidates. We'll have to see if this is enough to sway the current [+ parlament_current_ciu +] leadership.

@public
title: Publicly side with the CUP and demand a different candidate!
subtitle: This will surely upset [+ parlament_current_ciu +].
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.rubicon || Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase < 1 || Q.coalition_phase_timer <= 0 || (Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_round || 0) >= Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase) return;
    if (Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name != "Artur Mas" && Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name != "Neus Munté") return;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_round = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_ciu_pressure = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_ciu_pressure || 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mas_pressure = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mas_pressure || 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_ciu_pressure += 2;
    if (Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind == "jxsi" || Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind == "jxcat") {
        Q.independence_trust -= 8;
        Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 9;
    } else {
        Q.independence_trust -= 4;
        Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 6;
    }
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_feud += 1;
!}

[? if parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind = "jxsi" or parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind = "jxcat": Against all the agreements that we signed on when forming [+ parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind +], we are publicly breaking the coalition's line and demanding a leadership change.?][? if parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind != "jxsi" and parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind != "jxcat": We are now publicly siding with the CUP and demanding that [+ parlament_current_ciu +] proposes a different candidate. Predictably, their leadership is not taking this kindly.?] We'll have to see if this is really worth it.
